{"2689920":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"WarSpawn","steam_appid":2689920,"required_age":0,"is_free":true,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WarSpawn<\/strong> is a multiplayer action PvP game inspired by old-school PvP classics such as <i>Rakion Online<\/i> and <i>Infinity Online<\/i>. Use teamwork to strategize and eliminate the enemy team's Elder God, or challenge yourself in the PvE Solo Survival mode. So come slash, stab, grab, blast, and launch your way to victory using various weapons with no timegates or pay-to-win, just dive right into the action and have fun! <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2689920\/extras\/796b2e7b0dd0e232063e0dae09e04316.poster.avif?t=1750355263\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2689920\/extras\/796b2e7b0dd0e232063e0dae09e04316.webm?t=1750355263\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2689920\/extras\/796b2e7b0dd0e232063e0dae09e04316.mp4?t=1750355263\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Dynamic hack-n-slash combat<\/strong>: Out-maneuver your opponents with well timed movement abilities. Engage them with light and heavy attack combo sets unique to each weapon. And finish them off with special ranged attacks as they attempt to flee. The tools at your disposal provides fast-paced dynamic gameplay with a combat system that aims to be easy to learn, difficult to master, and always fun.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2689920\/e